      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Drover's Rest, from about 18:00 to 23:00 on Day 14, I saw Elias, Felix, Oskar, Ruth and Tomas, coming and going; Felix and Tomas were the worse for drink.",
