      "key": "K0113",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 14: from about 13:15 to 20:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 20:19 I passed through Mill Road; around 20:25 I passed through the square; from about 20:30 to 22:00 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:04 I passed through the square; around 22:10 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 19514,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
