      "in": "K0169",
      "key": "K0170",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 14: from about 13:15 to 18:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 18:20 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:30 to 22:00 I was at the square; from about 22:00 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 19514,
      "topics": [
