      "key": "K0277",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 14: from about 13:15 to 18:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 18:15 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 19:15 I was at the Kessler house; around 19:15 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:15 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:03 I passed through the square; around 07:05 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:00 to 07:15 I was at the mill.",
      "time": 19514,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
