      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 14: from about 13:15 to 23:00 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 23:07 I passed through the square; around 23:13 I passed through Mill Road; from about 23:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
