      "key": "K0402",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 14: from about 13:15 to 14:00 I was at home; around 14:04 I passed through the square; from about 14:15 to 15:15 I was at the Kessler house; around 15:14 I passed through the square; from about 15:15 to 19:00 I was at home; around 19:07 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:13 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 19514,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "jonas",
       "tomas"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0403",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "Jonas and I have never got on \u2014 an unpaid bill from last winter.",
      "time": null,
